# The transverse wavelength of this beam is 4.1 um: an absorber thinner than that reflects, a wider one can be gentler.
# Reference: the same propagation stepped independently in NumPy.
title Tilted beam meeting a 2 um absorber
grid dx=0.05 dz=0.25
window width=34 length=150
absorber width=2 strength=0.3
launch gaussian x=0 radius=5 tilt=15
plane end z=150
expect total end 0.014094841 2e-7
expect centroid end -1.5776130 2e-6
expect radius end 12.7241369 2e-6
expect neff 1.417072478 2e-8
